  "profile": {
    "storyTitle": "Profile",
    "text": "Ripresa, manager of a well-known orchestra in Nuova Volsinii who contacted us after observing that many with positions of power in the city have ties to Rhodes Island, in the hope of increasing exposure for her orchestra. She participates in certain field missions at her own request."
